    the officiant's pronouncement until the hall closes. Using it opens an entrance portal where you stand on your \
    channel, and anyone can go through it to the after-party map. Small print at the bottom reads \
    'Congratulations! Have a great party with your guests!' After the party, the portal takes you back to the \
    wedding hall."
