set key[id=20210047] mainDescription "Learn the We Got Married action"
set key[id=20210047] tooltipDescription "A pass that teaches you a two-person dynamic action."
set key[id=20210047] guideDescription "Double-click it to learn a special two-person action. Then right-click the \
    character you want to do it with > click the buddy action button > pick the dynamic action to ask them. You \
    can only ask characters within 3 m, and the action plays only if they accept. Once they accept, you move next \
    to them and do the action.\\nSome actions differ by the other character's gender."
