# KR-only items (feature ItemKR) with no English row in any pack: our own English names and descriptions from
# the KMS2 text, with each row's own format fields, font tags, line breaks and links; set bonus texts name the
# partner item by its English name in the name table. Plurals follow from the names (plural-of).
