set key[id=11120002] tooltipDescription "Trendy fashionistas' must-have item! Glasses with an eye-catching leopard \
    print."
set key[id=11120002] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11120014] tooltipDescription "A hygienic eye patch that covers one eye."
set key[id=11120014] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11120021] tooltipDescription "An eye patch with a cute skull drawn on it."
set key[id=11120021] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11120024] tooltipDescription "Elaborate goggles made of many tiny parts."
set key[id=11120024] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11120038] tooltipDescription "Horn-rimmed glasses that give a neat, smart impression."
set key[id=11120038] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11150074] tooltipDescription "Sunglasses with eye-catching bat wings spread out on both sides."
set key[id=11200089] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear refined from the weapons of the Terunkalib \
    commanders who had become Lapentouched. While purifying the influence of the Black Shard, it was improved and \
    strengthened so that its powerful energy can be used for good. The Lapenta energy stored in the gear can be \
    used directly, so it demands care and skill from the user, but the moment you become one with the gear, the \
    greatest power is as good as yours.</font>\\n\\n<i><font color='#7A7A7A'>'If even my tainted remnants can \
    help... I consider it an honor.'\\n- Ishura</font></i>"
set key[id=11200091] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>A plain, modest and lonely-looking accessory left \
    behind by an unnamed adventurer. Judging by the old red stains, its original owner seems to have met a bad \
    fate. Everyone called it ominous, but somehow it feels warm and familiar.</font>"
set key[id=11200092] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Ornaments of the Centurion Heavy Infantry, the 100 \
    elite soldiers who fought an unknown existence in the great war of the past. They have wandered between this \
    world and the otherworld for an unimaginably long time, but the brave power that once wrapped their owners \
    remains.</font>"
set key[id=11260101] tooltipDescription "Silver earrings of a devoted adventurer."
set key[id=11260101] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items.\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The Lumistone in the socket and the base option and set option effects only take effect \
    when equipped in the Skin tab."
set key[id=11301154] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear carried by the fearsome outlaw of the sea, \
    Captain Moke, and his pirate crew. It was thought to be ordinary pirate equipment, but through a sea serpent's \
    curse it has a strong affinity for everything related to water and cold. It was surely Moke's idea for naval \
    combat, but its potential should also work in cold regions other than the sea.</font>"
