set key[id=11301209] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Energy Mutation Enhancement]\\nThe \
    Energy Mutation effect is doubled.\\n\\n[Resonance with Blue Lapenshard]\\nGrants immunity to Rendubian's \
    curse effect in Grave Blue. This effect activates only when both Energy Mutation and Energy Mutation \
    Enhancement are active.</font>"
set key[id=11301209] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Elite gear made for the army of Madria, the first \
    of the Black Mage's Seven Generals. It was made by working metal tainted by darkness with dragon magic, so it \
    has considerable physical defense and magic protection, and is said to be especially effective at blocking \
    space mutation effects, which are known to be the opposite of dragon magic.</font>"
