set key[id=11301513] tooltipDescription "A headpiece shaped like a plump, cleaned mackerel. It seems to give off a \
    fishy smell."
set key[id=11301514] tooltipDescription "A hat of refreshing mint ice cream sprinkled with sweet toppings. It \
    doesn't melt even in hot weather."
set key[id=11301515] tooltipDescription "A bright full moon floats above your head and lights the way ahead, \
    enriching your heart."
set key[id=11301516] tooltipDescription "A flower that dances happily above your head."
set key[id=11301517] tooltipDescription "A ribbon with a bold stripe running across the middle."
set key[id=11301518] tooltipDescription "A green clover hat filled with good luck."
set key[id=11301519] tooltipDescription "A hairband that looks even better when worn as spring breezes blow and \
    cherry blossoms scatter."
set key[id=11301571] tooltipDescription "A hat shaped like $npc:11000406$'s favorite ice cream, \
    '$npcName:11000406$ Is an Alien'.\\n'$npcName:11000406$ Is an Alien', with white, milk and dark chocolate \
    studded with rainbow sprinkles, is sweet and crunchy. It is now a top-selling product, but at launch nobody \
    expected it to get this popular, so they used popular $npc:11000406$ as the ad model and gave it a unique name \
    to promote it.\\nRumor has it that at launch $npcName:11000406$ suggested to the advertiser that a mint flavor \
    mixed in would be even better, but was coldly turned down with 'we can't mix toothpaste flavor into \
    chocolate', and was very sad. "
set key[id=11301589] tooltipDescription "Zakum's helmet, which has absorbed Zakum's power for a long time. It \
    stores Zakum's mighty power and draws out the hidden strength of the warrior who wears it. A trace of Zakum's \
    will lingers in it, so be careful: using it for a long time may let Zakum take over your mind completely."
set key[id=11301589] guideDescription "An item that can be crafted using Mysterious Zakum Helmet pieces."
set key[id=11304839] tooltipDescription "Plump hearts circle above your head, spreading the aura of love."
set key[id=11320201] tooltipDescription "Closed-back headphones with a rich sound."
set key[id=11320201] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320202] tooltipDescription "Adorable bunny ears headband."
set key[id=11320202] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320207] tooltipDescription "You don't know who I am, right? A hat to use when you want to hide your \
    face."
set key[id=11320207] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320208] tooltipDescription "A hat modeled on the stalk of a blue green onion."
set key[id=11320208] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320383] tooltipDescription "A big ribbon with a lovely heart-shaped decoration."
set key[id=11320384] tooltipDescription "Plump hearts circle above your head, spreading the aura of love."
set key[id=11320385] tooltipDescription "A flower that dances happily above your head."
set key[id=11320386] tooltipDescription "A bucket hat of a devoted adventurer."
set key[id=11320386] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items.\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The Lumistone in the socket and the base option and set option effects only take effect \
    when equipped in the Skin tab."
set key[id=11320435] tooltipDescription "Clothing themed on a mischievous little devil."
set key[id=11320435] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320436] tooltipDescription "A helmet made of sturdy steel."
set key[id=11320436] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320437] tooltipDescription "A bamboo hat roughly woven from thin strips to keep off rain and sun."
set key[id=11320437] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320438] tooltipDescription "An angular hat worn by crew members."
set key[id=11320438] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11320439] tooltipDescription "A small hat worn by crew members."
set key[id=11320439] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11390947] tooltipDescription "A hat shaped like a bowl of rice cake soup with chewy rice cakes and \
    dumplings."
set key[id=11400972] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear carried by the fearsome outlaw of the sea, \
    Captain Moke, and his pirate crew. It was thought to be ordinary pirate equipment, but through a sea serpent's \
    curse it has a strong affinity for everything related to water and cold. It was surely Moke's idea for naval \
    combat, but its potential should also work in cold regions other than the sea.</font>"
set key[id=11400973] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear carried by the fearsome outlaw of the sea, \
    Captain Moke, and his pirate crew. It was thought to be ordinary pirate equipment, but through a sea serpent's \
    curse it has a strong affinity for everything related to water and cold. It was surely Moke's idea for naval \
    combat, but its potential should also work in cold regions other than the sea.</font>"
