set key[id=11500896] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear bestowed on the few fanatics favored by Madria. \
    Its showy, wing-like ornaments make it look unfit for combat, but unlike its looks it is powerful, nimble and \
    deadly. The core of this gear, however, is the powerful magic protection spell Madria cast on it. Oddly, this \
    spell is far from the magic used in the Maple World, so scholars analyze that the gear was made to prepare for \
    fights against beings from outer space that are hard to imagine.</font>"
