    Acceleration effect is doubled.\\n\\n[Resonance with Red Lapenshard]\\nGrants immunity to Ishura's curse \
    effect in Terminus Ends. This effect activates only when both Acceleration and Acceleration Enhancement are \
    active.</font>"
