set key[id=11620241] tooltipDescription "Special gloves with anti-slip treatment."
set key[id=11620241] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11620315] tooltipDescription "Simple gloves worn by wandering warriors."
set key[id=11620315] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11620383] tooltipDescription "A devoted adventurer's gloves."
set key[id=11620383] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items.\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The Lumistone in the socket and the base option and set option effects only take effect \
    when equipped in the Skin tab."
set key[id=11701136] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear carried by the fearsome outlaw of the sea, \
    Captain Moke, and his pirate crew. It was thought to be ordinary pirate equipment, but through a sea serpent's \
    curse it has a strong affinity for everything related to water and cold. It was surely Moke's idea for naval \
    combat, but its potential should also work in cold regions other than the sea.</font>"
