set key[id=11701202] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Stabilized Aura]\\nEach time you are \
    affected by the unstable power of the Lapenshard, its aura stabilizes and physical and magic damage increase \
    by 3% for 180 sec. This effect stacks up to 3 times.\\n\\n[Resonance with All Lapenshards]\\nGrants immunity \
    to curse effects in Emerald Prison, Grave Blue, Terminus Ends and Black Shard Chamber. This effect activates \
    only when the Unstable Lapenshard Power effect is active.</font>"
set key[id=11701202] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear refined from the weapons of the Terunkalib \
    commanders who had become Lapentouched. While purifying the influence of the Black Shard, it was improved and \
    strengthened so that its powerful energy can be used for good. The Lapenta energy stored in the gear can be \
    used directly, so it demands care and skill from the user, but the moment you become one with the gear, the \
    greatest power is as good as yours.</font>\\n\\n<i><font color='#7A7A7A'>'If even my tainted remnants can \
    help... I consider it an honor.'\\n- Ishura</font></i>"
set key[id=11701203] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Stabilized Aura]\\nEach time you are \
    affected by the unstable power of the Lapenshard, its aura stabilizes and physical and magic damage increase \
    by 3% for 180 sec. This effect stacks up to 3 times.\\n\\n[Resonance with All Lapenshards]\\nGrants immunity \
    to curse effects in Emerald Prison, Grave Blue, Terminus Ends and Black Shard Chamber. This effect activates \
    only when the Unstable Lapenshard Power effect is active.</font>"
