    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* The Lumistone in the socket and the base option and set option effects only take effect \
    when equipped in the Skin tab."
set key[id=11720412] tooltipDescription "Waterproof boots. They also resist heat."
set key[id=11720412] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11800113] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear refined from the weapons of the Terunkalib \
    commanders who had become Lapentouched. While purifying the influence of the Black Shard, it was improved and \
    strengthened so that its powerful energy can be used for good. The Lapenta energy stored in the gear can be \
    used directly, so it demands care and skill from the user, but the moment you become one with the gear, the \
    greatest power is as good as yours.</font>\\n\\n<i><font color='#7A7A7A'>'If even my tainted remnants can \
    help... I consider it an honor.'\\n- Ishura</font></i>"
set key[id=11800116] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>A plain, modest and lonely-looking accessory left \
    behind by an unnamed adventurer. Judging by the old red stains, its original owner seems to have met a bad \
    fate. Everyone called it ominous, but somehow it feels warm and familiar.</font>"
set key[id=11800117] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Ornaments of the Centurion Heavy Infantry, the 100 \
    elite soldiers who fought an unknown existence in the great war of the past. They have wandered between this \
    world and the otherworld for an unimaginably long time, but the brave power that once wrapped their owners \
    remains.</font>"
set key[id=11800141] tooltipDescription "A yellow pot lid."
set key[id=11800142] tooltipDescription "A cape shaped like the rabbit pounding in a mortar on the full moon."
set key[id=11800143] tooltipDescription "A winged jack-o'-lantern. Tie it down tightly with a string so it doesn't \
    fly far away."
set key[id=11800145] tooltipDescription "A chic balloon cape skin specially provided to celebrate the 4th \
    anniversary of MapleStory 2."
set key[id=11820025] tooltipDescription "Small, cute devil wings."
set key[id=11820025] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11820026] tooltipDescription "Angel wings made of soft feathers."
set key[id=11820026] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11820115] tooltipDescription "Strap on a rocket and fly through the sky!"
set key[id=11820115] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11820116] tooltipDescription "A backpack shaped like a coffin with a skull pattern."
set key[id=11820116] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11820117] tooltipDescription "A thin, long devil tail."
set key[id=11820117] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
set key[id=11820118] tooltipDescription "A large backpack that holds plenty of supplies."
set key[id=11820118] guideDescription "A skin item that can be worn together with game items."
