set key[id=13400287] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Body Reinforcement]\\nOn hit, 10% chance \
    to increase attack speed by 10% for 24 sec. This effect activates only with a Frontier Star in each \
    hand.\\n\\n[Specialization B]\\nIn Madrakan Spire, the Body Reinforcement effect is tripled.\\n\\nNot applied \
    in battlefields and arenas.</font>"
set key[id=13400287] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Armament set ordered as standard issue for the \
    Frontier Foundation. It was planned to be issued to all Foundation guards, survey teams and participating \
    adventurers, but the entire shipment was ambushed and lost in transit. Because of a price far beyond that of \
    ordinary standard gear, no replacement was ever produced; rumor has it the enormous cost comes from \
    anti-dragon metal, a special metal made for fighting dragons.</font>"
set key[id=13400288] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Precision]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to \
    increase accuracy by 9 for 8 sec. This effect activates only with a Vepar's Demonwing Star in each \
    hand.\\n\\n[Specialization C]\\nAgainst Otherworldly Beings, the Precision effect is tripled.\\n\\nNot applied \
    in battlefields and arenas.</font>"
set key[id=13400288] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear bestowed on the few fanatics favored by \
    Madria. Its showy, wing-like ornaments make it look unfit for combat, but unlike its looks it is powerful, \
    nimble and deadly. The core of this gear, however, is the powerful magic protection spell Madria cast on it. \
    Oddly, this spell is far from the magic used in the Maple World, so scholars analyze that the gear was made to \
    prepare for fights against beings from outer space that are hard to imagine.</font>"
set key[id=13400289] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Beast's Wrath]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to \
    increase physical/magic attack by 48 for 12 sec. This effect activates only with a Behemoth Spike in each \
    hand."
set key[id=13400289] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear made from the remains of Behemoth, the giant \
    beast that terrorized the snowfields. It was made with technology from the distant past, so the hide, horns \
    and bones are merely joined together with little processing, yet it is said to be more than enough to serve \
    its purpose. Behemoth's hide is closer to steel, its horn compares to a battering ram that topples fortresses, \
    and the beast's wrath soaked into the bone tears apart any magic. But be careful. Equipping this gear means, \
    in a word, becoming Behemoth. It means you must forever satisfy an endless craving for life.</font>"
set key[id=13400290] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Acceleration]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to \
    increase accuracy by 9 and attack speed by 9% for 12 sec. This effect activates only with a Enigma Shrapnel in \
    each hand."
set key[id=13400290] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Unidentified gear pulled into the Maple World \
    along with a time rift of unknown cause. According to the analysis of the time traveler Endy, this gear exists \
    in the same phase on the past, present and future time axes, and because of this its appearance is formed to \
    match the current level of understanding. Of course, no one in the entire Maple World could understand this \
    analysis exactly, but the parts of the report that sounded good were that the gear performs extremely well, is \
    light and sturdy, and that the energy waves peculiar to outer-space material keep the time axis from \
    shifting.</font>"
set key[id=13400291] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Energy Mutation]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to \
    increase Combat Power by 1300 for 12 sec. This effect activates only with a Dark Vanguard Reaper in each \
    hand."
set key[id=13400291] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Elite gear made for the army of Madria, the first \
    of the Black Mage's Seven Generals. It was made by working metal tainted by darkness with dragon magic, so it \
    has considerable physical defense and magic protection, and is said to be especially effective at blocking \
    space mutation effects, which are known to be the opposite of dragon magic.</font>"
set key[id=13400292] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Unstable Lapenshard Power]\\nOn hit, \
    there is a set chance that one of the powers of Life, Space or Time activates and affects up to 10 allies \
    within 6m, including you. Life restores 5000 HP, Space increases accuracy by 3 and defense penetration by 3% \
    for 15 sec, and Time increases attack speed and movement speed by 3% for 15 sec.  This effect activates only \
    when you equip Blackpurity Lapendow Storms in both hands. Not applied in battlefields and arenas."
set key[id=13400292] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear refined from the weapons of the Terunkalib \
    commanders who had become Lapentouched. While purifying the influence of the Black Shard, it was improved and \
    strengthened so that its powerful energy can be used for good. The Lapenta energy stored in the gear can be \
    used directly, so it demands care and skill from the user, but the moment you become one with the gear, the \
    greatest power is as good as yours.</font>\\n\\n<i><font color='#7A7A7A'>'If even my tainted remnants can \
    help... I consider it an honor.'\\n- Ishura</font></i>"
set key[id=14000249] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Curse]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to increase \
    Combat Power by 372 for 12 sec. This effect activates only when worn with the Tidemaster \
    Scepter.\\n\\n[Specialization A] \\nIn Frostpillar Temple, the Curse effect is tripled.\\n\\nNot applied in \
    battlefields and arenas.</font>"
set key[id=14000249] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear carried by the fearsome outlaw of the sea, \
    Captain Moke, and his pirate crew. It was thought to be ordinary pirate equipment, but through a sea serpent's \
    curse it has a strong affinity for everything related to water and cold. It was surely Moke's idea for naval \
    combat, but its potential should also work in cold regions other than the sea.</font>"
set key[id=14000250] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Body Reinforcement]\\nOn hit, 10% chance \
    to increase attack speed by 10% for 24 sec. This effect activates only when worn with the Frontier \
    Scepter.\\n\\n[Specialization B]\\nIn Madrakan Spire, the Body Reinforcement effect is tripled.\\n\\nNot \
    applied in battlefields and arenas.</font>"
set key[id=14000250] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Armament set ordered as standard issue for the \
    Frontier Foundation. It was planned to be issued to all Foundation guards, survey teams and participating \
    adventurers, but the entire shipment was ambushed and lost in transit. Because of a price far beyond that of \
    ordinary standard gear, no replacement was ever produced; rumor has it the enormous cost comes from \
    anti-dragon metal, a special metal made for fighting dragons.</font>"
set key[id=14000251] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Precision]\\nOn hit, 10% chance to \
    increase accuracy by 9 for 8 sec. This effect activates only when worn with the Phenex's Demonwing \
    Scepter.\\n\\n[Specialization C]\\nAgainst Otherworldly Beings, the Precision effect is tripled.\\n\\nNot \
    applied in battlefields and arenas.</font>"
