set key[id=15600218] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Elite gear made for the army of Madria, the first \
    of the Black Mage's Seven Generals. It was made by working metal tainted by darkness with dragon magic, so it \
    has considerable physical defense and magic protection, and is said to be especially effective at blocking \
    space mutation effects, which are known to be the opposite of dragon magic.</font>"
set key[id=15600219] tooltipDescription "<font color='#ff8ae5' size='14'>[Unstable Lapenshard Power]\\nOn hit, \
    there is a set chance that one of the powers of Life, Space or Time activates and affects up to 10 allies \
    within 6m, including you. Life restores 5000 HP, Space increases accuracy by 3 and defense penetration by 3% \
    for 15 sec, and Time increases attack speed and movement speed by 3% for 15 sec.  Not applied in battlefields \
    and arenas."
set key[id=15600219] guideDescription "\\n<font color='#7A7A7A'>Gear refined from the weapons of the Terunkalib \
    commanders who had become Lapentouched. While purifying the influence of the Black Shard, it was improved and \
    strengthened so that its powerful energy can be used for good. The Lapenta energy stored in the gear can be \
    used directly, so it demands care and skill from the user, but the moment you become one with the gear, the \
    greatest power is as good as yours.</font>\\n\\n<i><font color='#7A7A7A'>'If even my tainted remnants can \
    help... I consider it an honor.'\\n- Ishura</font></i>"
set key[id=20000244] mainDescription "<font size='14'>Duration 1 min\\n<font size='24'>Summon Bat Swarm</font>"
set key[id=20000244] tooltipDescription "Purple candy shaped like a bat."
set key[id=20000244] guideDescription "Eating it lets you summon a swarm of black bats around you for 1 minute."
set key[id=20000968] mainDescription "<font size='14'>15 Min Cooldown | 15 Min Duration</font>\\n<font \
    size='24'>Eat Pizza</font>"
set key[id=20000968] tooltipDescription "<font color='#00aaef'>Places a piping hot Maple pizza on the ground for \
    15 sec. Party members within 3m who eat the pizza gain 650 Combat Power for 15 min. It does not stack with \
    other offensive magic elixirs, and the effect is not removed on death. This item's effect applies only in \
    Chaos Raids.</font>"
set key[id=20000968] guideDescription "<font color='#7A7A7A'>\\nA warm pizza prepared for your companions. Its \
    taste and smell alone are enough to make your mouth water.</font>"
