    can get various rewards, including Chaonyx."
set key[id=20302691] tooltipDescription "Pump air into the Ducky pool in Queenstown with the $item:20302691$ to \
    make it grow! You can use the $item:20302691$ 10 times a day."
set key[id=20302691] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302691$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by playing \
    for 30 minutes each day</font>"
set key[id=20302697] tooltipDescription "A gift box given out specially to celebrate the 4th anniversary of \
    MapleStory 2."
set key[id=20302699] tooltipDescription "A special gift box you receive for completing all the stamp missions. It \
    holds a cute alpaca and a purple heart balloon."
set key[id=20302704] tooltipDescription "A box that lets you choose the swim tube badge you want."
set key[id=20302704] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside.<font \
    color='#FF5F5F'>\\n\\n* Swim tube badges become character-bound when equipped.</font>"
set key[id=20302718] tooltipDescription "A box that lets you choose the 2-player action pass you want."
set key[id=20302718] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside.<font \
    color='#FF5F5F'>\\n\\n* 2-player action passes cannot be traded.</font>"
set key[id=20302734] tooltipDescription "A special box that can give you various rewards. "
set key[id=20302734] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=20302757] tooltipDescription "A magic scroll holding a chance to turn your Maple 2 life around. It can \
    only be opened on weekdays (Monday to Friday) during the event period."
set key[id=20302757] guideDescription "\\nWhat is $item:20301858$?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Find the golden \
    scrolls that spawn in fields on weekdays (Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri) to get up to 10 a day.\\n- With luck, you \
    can get a 'Jackpot! Golden Meso Scroll'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of a variety of items. \\n- \
    Just opening the box gives you 1 Ducky Coin.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you \
    can get. Many more items are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20302758] tooltipDescription "A magic scroll holding a chance to turn your Maple 2 life around. It can \
    only be opened on Saturdays and Sundays during the event period."
set key[id=20302758] guideDescription "\\nWhat is $item:20301858$?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Find the golden \
    scrolls that spawn in fields on weekends (Sat/Sun) to get up to 10 a day.\\n- With luck, you can get a \
    'Jackpot! Golden Necklace Scroll'.\\n- Even without luck, everyone gets one of a variety of items. \\n- Just \
    opening the box gives you 1 Ducky Coin.\\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can \
    get. Many more items are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20302759] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you 400 million mesos. \\nIf you got this scroll, you \
    are one of the luckiest players in MapleStory 2 history."
set key[id=20302760] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the Peridot Necklace of Heavenly Luck. \\nIf you got \
    this scroll, you are one of the luckiest players in MapleStory 2 history."
set key[id=20302761] tooltipDescription "A MapleStory 2 memorial item. You can choose one of various boss skins. "
set key[id=20302761] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302762] tooltipDescription "A MapleStory 2 memorial item. You can choose one of various boss skins. "
set key[id=20302762] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302763] tooltipDescription "A MapleStory 2 memorial item. You can choose one of various boss skins. "
set key[id=20302763] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302764] tooltipDescription "A pouch filled with mesos."
set key[id=20302764] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to receive mesos."
set key[id=20302792] tooltipDescription "This award is given for completing the Summer Marble board 20 or more \
    times."
set key[id=20302792] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302792$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n* Go to the Marble \
    map through the event map shortcut, roll the dice to play, and finish 20 laps of the board to receive \
    it.</font>"
set key[id=20302793] tooltipDescription "This award is given for reaching the attendance goal during the event \
    period. "
set key[id=20302793] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302793$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n* 1 is given as the \
    attendance reward on days 6, 9, and 12. You need 3 in total.</font>"
set key[id=20302794] tooltipDescription "This award is given for meeting the moon rabbit at $map:80000022$ during \
    the Chuseok period. "
set key[id=20302794] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:20302794$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n* 1 is given each \
    time you play the Chuseok mini game $map:80000022$ once. You need 3 in total.</font>"
set key[id=20302810] tooltipDescription "A box containing 300 Shining Blessing Stones, 700 Metacells, and 400 \
    Chaonyx Crystals. Shining Blessing Stones and Metacells are character-bound items, so once you get them you \
    cannot move them to another character. Think carefully before opening the box."
set key[id=20302810] guideDescription "Double-click the package item in your inventory to receive the items. Some \
    of the items you get are bound to your character."
set key[id=20302812] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you a special pet capsule."
set key[id=20302812] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302931] tooltipDescription "A box that lets you choose one of $item:50600120$ and $item:50600123$."
set key[id=20302931] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20302932] tooltipDescription "A box holding various stories from the Maple World."
set key[id=20302932] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside. "
set key[id=20303031] tooltipDescription "A box given to those who have returned to the Maple World.\\nIt holds \
    various items that help you start your adventure anew."
set key[id=20303031] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to receive the items.\\n\\n<font \
    color=\"#FF5F5F\">* Some of the items inside are character-bound.</font>"
set key[id=20303033] tooltipDescription "A box that lets you choose 1 of $item:20303034$ and $item:20303035$"
set key[id=20303033] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to choose 1 of the items inside."
set key[id=20303034] tooltipDescription "A box containing the Tyrenn Commander Combat gear for your class."
set key[id=20303035] tooltipDescription "A box containing the Antique Infenuk gear for your class."
set key[id=20303036] tooltipDescription "A box containing a Tyrenn Rensha accessory."
set key[id=20303041] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the [Hide Well] title."
set key[id=20303042] tooltipDescription "A box that gives you the [Hide-and-Seek Master] title."
set key[id=20303096] tooltipDescription "A box holding outfit items for a lovely look."
set key[id=20303100] tooltipDescription "A raffle ticket that gives you a chance to win a 2020 MapleStory 2 \
    calendar. "
set key[id=20303100] guideDescription "\\nHow to get a 2020 MapleStory 2 calendar<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Keep \
    this raffle ticket until December 31, 2019.\\n- Watch for the raffle announcement on the official website.\\n- \
    If you are chosen as a winner, you will go through a shipping address collection step and then receive the \
    2020 MapleStory 2 calendar.</font>"
set key[id=20303101] tooltipDescription "A box holding outfit items for a diligent adventurer."
set key[id=20303113] tooltipDescription "Given to each couple who married between November 21, 2019 and December \
    19, 2019, to celebrate the opening of the marriage system. "
set key[id=20303128] tooltipDescription "If you received this challenge ticket, go to the MapleStory 2 website \
    quickly to claim first-come, first-served Nexon Cash. "
set key[id=20303128] guideDescription "\\nHow to get first-come, first-served Nexon Cash<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- \
    Get this item by playing for 1 hour.\\n- Visit the event page on the official website.\\n- Click the Get Nexon \
    Cash button to see whether you won a first-come, first-served prize.</font>"
set key[id=20303129] tooltipDescription "If you received this challenge ticket, go to the MapleStory 2 website \
