set key[id=20303136] tooltipDescription "A special gift box prepared for adventurers who joined the Limit Break \
    pre-registration event."
set key[id=20303136] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to receive the items. The items you get \
    are bound to your character."
set key[id=20303138] tooltipDescription "A special gift box Schwanda prepared for the white winter."
set key[id=20303139] tooltipDescription "A Meta Badge only lets you bring out the power of a Meta Core. It is the \
    Meta Core that gathers the magic energy scattered across the Maple World and turns it into stats."
set key[id=20303139] guideDescription "\\nHow to get<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Can be obtained at a set chance by \
    defeating monsters, playing instruments, or fishing\\n- Up to 60 can be obtained per day</font>"
set key[id=20303177] tooltipDescription "A lucky chance from Black Bean! It can only be obtained and opened on \
    Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays between January 17 and January 31. "
set key[id=20303177] guideDescription "\\nWhat is $item:20303177$?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Find the Black Bean \
    balloons that appear all over the Maple World to get one.\\n- It can only be obtained and opened on Fridays, \
    Saturdays, and Sundays between January 17 and January 31. \\n- With luck, you can get a 'Jackpot! Black Bean's \
    Gift of Time and Space'. \\n- Even without luck, you always get Crystal Fragments, Onyx Crystals, Chaonyx \
    Crystals, and Black Bean Coins. \\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can get. \
    Many more items are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20303178] tooltipDescription "A lucky chance from Black Bean! It can only be obtained and opened on \
    Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays between February 1 and February 16. "
set key[id=20303178] guideDescription "\\nWhat is $item:20303178$?<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Find the Black Bean \
    balloons that appear all over the Maple World to get one.\\n- It can only be obtained and opened on Fridays, \
    Saturdays, and Sundays between February 1 and February 16. \\n- With luck, you can get a 'Jackpot! Black \
    Bean's Gift of Lapenshard'. \\n- Even without luck, you always get Crystal Fragments, Onyx Crystals, Chaonyx \
    Crystals, and Black Bean Coins. \\n\\n* The main items listed below are only some of the items you can get. \
    Many more items are included.<font color='#FFFFFF'></font>"
set key[id=20303179] tooltipDescription "If you got this box, you are the luckiest person Black Bean ever picked!"
set key[id=20303180] tooltipDescription "If you got this box, you are the luckiest person Black Bean ever picked!"
set key[id=20303182] tooltipDescription "A box of chocolates given to every adventurer for Valentine's Day. \
    Besides chocolates, it holds some other notable items."
set key[id=20303211] tooltipDescription "A box holding items that help adventurers who break their limits and grow \
    stronger."
set key[id=20303217] tooltipDescription "A Meta Badge only lets you bring out the power of a Meta Core. It is the \
    Meta Core that gathers the magic energy scattered across the Maple World and turns it into stats."
set key[id=20303217] guideDescription "\\nHow to get<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Can be obtained at a set chance by \
