    color='#45D1FF'>Fishing Badge: Merry Christmas</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font \
    color='#45D1FF'>Unicorn Champion Weapon Box</font><font color='#FF5F5F'>\\n\\n* The main items may change \
    later, so open it as soon as you get it.</font>"
set key[id=22004002] tooltipDescription "A Happy New Year special capsule. Use it to get one of the various items \
    in the capsule machine."
set key[id=22004002] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to use it.\\n\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'>Main items you can get</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#C888FF'>Modern \
    Hanbok Skin</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#45D1FF'>14 Beauty Coupons</font>\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#C888FF'>Effect Badge: Super Hero</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - \
    </font><font color='#C888FF'>Effect Badge: Aurora</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font \
    color='#C888FF'>Couple Effect Badge Set: Meso Fireworks</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font \
    color='#45D1FF'>Hamster Violin</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#45D1FF'>Hamster \
    Cello</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#45D1FF'>Stained Glass Weapon Box</font>\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'> - </font><font color='#9EDB48'>Super World Chat Bundle: Mouse</font><font \
    color='#FF5F5F'>\\n\\n* The main items may change later, so open it as soon as you get it.</font>"
set key[id=22004003] tooltipDescription "A special capsule released to celebrate the 5th anniversary of MapleStory \
    2. Use it to get one of the various items in the capsule machine."
set key[id=22004003] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to use it."
set key[id=22004004] tooltipDescription "A special capsule released to celebrate the 6th anniversary of MapleStory \
    2. Use it to get one of the various items in the capsule machine."
set key[id=22004004] guideDescription "Double-click it in your inventory to use it.\\n\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'>Main items you can get</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'><font color='#FFD533'> - Olympus \
    Skin</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Fresh Lemon Skin</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Elegant Gothic \
    Skin</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Imperial Gold Weapon Box</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Stained \
    Glass Weapon Box</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Swirly Lollipop</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Charming \
    Pony</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Holy White Calf</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Bouncy Mother Duck \
    Boat</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Effect Badge: Twirling Rose</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Couple \
    Effect Badge Set: Spring Festival</font>\\n<font color='#C888FF'> - Couple Effect Badge Set: Pink \
    Rose</font>\\n<font color='#45D1FF'> - Tombstone Badge: Lazy Mushroom</font>\\n<font color='#45D1FF'> - Damage \
    Font Badge: Fun Picnic</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - Speech Bubble Badge: Founders</font>\\n<font \
    color='#FFFFFF'> - Speech Bubble Badge: Fun Picnic</font>\\n<font color='#FFFFFF'> - Nametag Badge: Fun \
    Picnic</font>\\n<font color='#FF5F5F'>\\n* The main items may change later, so open it as soon as you get \
    it.</font>"
set key[id=22204001] tooltipDescription "A Christmas special coin. Use it to buy items at the coin shop that sells \
    the special capsule contents."
set key[id=22204001] guideDescription "$item:22204001$ can be obtained by disassembling items you got from \
    $item:22004001$.\\nDouble-click it in your inventory to open the coin shop."
