    sells the skin capsule contents."
set key[id=22204002] guideDescription "$item:22204002$ can be obtained by disassembling items you got from \
    $item:22004002$.\\nDouble-click it in your inventory to open the coin shop."
set key[id=22204003] tooltipDescription "A special coin released to celebrate the 5th anniversary of MapleStory 2. \
