set key[id=30001347] tooltipDescription "A rainbow candy made with a special recipe. It still looks colorful and \
    tasty, but it is even more special. If you lock a pet's bonus talents with the Sparkling Rainbow Candy, the \
    locked talent types and values do not change even when you reroll the pet's bonus talents. The sparkling \
    special power lets you lock up to 3 of a pet's talents."
set key[id=30001347] guideDescription "Used up when you lock bonus talents while changing a pet's talents. The \
    talent types and values you select with this item are locked. You can lock up to 3 types of talents."
set key[id=30001369] tooltipDescription "Collect a certain amount and exchange them for a Nexon Cash ticket at NPC \
    Kiki's shop in Queenstown. Exchange them before they expire."
set key[id=30001370] tooltipDescription "A ticket that gives you 10 won of Nexon Cash if you keep it in your \
    inventory. If you throw the item away before it expires, the Nexon Cash cannot be paid out, so be careful not \
    to throw it away."
set key[id=30001370] guideDescription "\\nNotice<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- After the event ends, you must complete \
    the receipt consent on the winner announcement board to be paid out properly. </font><font \
    color='#FF5F5F'>\\n- If you throw the item away before it expires, the Nexon Cash cannot be paid out.</font>"
set key[id=30001371] tooltipDescription "A ticket that gives you 100 won of Nexon Cash if you keep it in your \
