    various field bosses."
set key[id=30001380] tooltipDescription "Collect 20 of the items you get from the 'Make a Pinwheel' event and take \
    them to Ruby to receive an action pass."
set key[id=30001382] tooltipDescription "A ticket that gives you 300 won of Nexon Cash if you keep it in your \
    inventory. If you throw the item away before the event ends, the Nexon Cash cannot be paid out, so be careful \
