set key[id=30001393] tooltipDescription "A mysteriously colored stone that time travelers sometimes come across. \
    In $map:63000079$ or $map:02000064$, take it to $npc:11004663$ to exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30001393] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001393$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by \
    completing the daily quest from $npc:11001002$ \\n- Get it through the Mystery Time Stamp\\n- Get it at a set \
    chance by fishing or playing music in $map:63000079$ and $map:63000080$"
set key[id=30001394] tooltipDescription "A coin with Ducky's face on it. Exchange it for various items at the shop \
    of $npc:11004674$."
set key[id=30001394] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001394$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by pumping \
    air into the Ducky pool in Queenstown each day \\n- Get it through the treasure hunt event"
set key[id=30001410] tooltipDescription "A commemorative coin for the mutual help campaign event, which aims to \
    build a warm Maple World where people help each other. In $map:02000064$, take it to $npc:11004243$ to \
    exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30001410] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001410$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by clearing \
    Lv 70 Adventure [Hard], Chaos Raid, or the Pitch-Black Crusade  \\n- Both the veteran adventurer who helped a \
    novice and the novice who asked for help receive it \\n- Up to 10 can be obtained per day</font>"
set key[id=30001422] tooltipDescription "A coin that sparkles like the sun in the sky.\\nDuring the event period, \
    you can use it to roll the dice in Summer Marble."
set key[id=30001422] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001422$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- 2 are sent by mail \
    each day when you log in\\n- 1 is given each at 20 and 40 minutes of staying logged in \\n- 2 are given at 60 \
    minutes of staying logged in</font>"
set key[id=30001437] tooltipDescription "An autographed CD from $npc:11000406$, the most popular guy in the Maple \
    World.\\nDespite his cold-looking appearance, $npcName:11000406$ is said to be good about signing autographs \
    and posing for photos. But he has a handsome man's bad handwriting, so it is hard to tell who the autograph \
    was made for.\\nIn $map:02000064$, take it to the biggest fan of $npcName:11000406$, $npc:11004726$, to \
    exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30001437] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001437$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Attendance \
    reward\\n- Reward for taking part in $map:51000005$\\n- Reward for the daily quest from \
    $npcName:11001002$</font>"
set key[id=30001443] tooltipDescription "A commemorative coin for the mutual help campaign event, which aims to \
    build a warm Maple World where people help each other. In $map:02000064$, take it to $npc:11004243$ to \
    exchange it for various items."
set key[id=30001443] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001410$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by clearing \
    Lv 70 Adventure [Hard], Chaos Raid, or the Pitch-Black Crusade  \\n- Both the veteran adventurer who helped a \
    novice and the novice who asked for help receive it \\n- Up to 10 can be obtained per day</font>"
set key[id=30001500] tooltipDescription "A material item for the 'Tteokguk Recipe' event. Can be obtained from \
    various field bosses."
set key[id=30001501] tooltipDescription "A material item for the 'Tteokguk Recipe' event. Can be obtained from \
    various field bosses."
set key[id=30001502] tooltipDescription "A material item for the 'Tteokguk Recipe' event. Can be obtained from \
    various field bosses."
set key[id=30001503] tooltipDescription "A material item for the 'Tteokguk Recipe' event. Can be obtained from \
    various field bosses."
set key[id=30001505] tooltipDescription "A small coin bearing the face of the mischievous Black Bean.\\nDuring the \
    event period, you can use it to buy various items at the Black Bean shop."
set key[id=30001505] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001505$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Attendance \
    reward\\n- Up to 9 per day as a participation reward in the Spin! Three, Two, One event\\n- Get it from the \
    magic hats you receive each time you find a Black Bean balloon on Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays</font>"
set key[id=30001509] tooltipDescription "A special gift from the warm spring breeze carrying a mysterious energy. \
    \\nIn $map:02000064$ on Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays, use it at the shop run by $npc:11004834$, who appears \
    there. \\nCan only be obtained on Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays. "
set key[id=30001509] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001509$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Get it by \
    completing the special mission held in $map:02000064$ every Fri, Sat, and Sun\\n- Get it as a login mail \
    reward every Fri, Sat, and Sun\\n- Get it by clearing dungeons, defeating field bosses, or joining mini games \
    hosted by MC Kay every Fri, Sat, and Sun\\n- Get it at a set chance by gathering, mining, farming, ranching, \
    or crafting every Fri, Sat, and Sun</font>"
set key[id=30001510] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from Hide-and-Seek. It is used to spin the \
    Hide-and-Seek event spin. The Hide-and-Seek event spin can be found in Queenstown."
set key[id=30001512] tooltipDescription "A coin modeled after fragrant spring petals. \\nTake it to Ruby in \
    Queenstown to exchange it for items."
set key[id=30001512] guideDescription "\\nHow to get $item:30001512$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n-Water the spring \
    blossom tree in Queenstown while holding the watering can you get by mail each day to get it from a 'Petal \
    Coin Box'\\n-Get it from the daily attendance reward</font>"
set key[id=30001516] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from the Spring of Darkness and various events. You \
    can exchange it with Babi for various goods."
set key[id=30001516] guideDescription "\\nWhere to get $item:30001516$<font color='#FFFFFF'>\\n- Spring of \
    Darkness\\n- Snowman Building event\\n- Piece Collecting event</font>"
set key[id=30001520] tooltipDescription "A coin made in the iconic shape of Mabinogi \\nYou can exchange it for \
    various goods with Babi, the event helper in Queenstown."
set key[id=30001520] guideDescription "Find the mysterious Nao balloons around the Maple World, then complete \
    Ruby's quest in Queenstown or Barbenie to get it."
set key[id=30001522] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from Hide-and-Seek. It is used to buy the things you \
    need at the event coin shop."
set key[id=30001524] tooltipDescription "A coin you can get from events. It is used to buy the things you need at \
    the event coin shop."
