set key[id=36000604] guideDescription "Double-click to use it. Spend 90 of them to make $item:11301589$."
set key[id=40200201] tooltipDescription "A refined gemstone, reprocessed from raw gemstone by extracting only \
    certain particles, and filled with concentrated power. Can be bought with Chaos Bit Coins or Guild Coins."
set key[id=40200201] guideDescription "Equip it on gear to gain the mysterious energy within the gemstone. \
    Dismantle it to get Jewel Dust."
